{"title": "Szass Tam", "pageid": 48522, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Szass_Tam", "categories": ["Mentioned characters", "Undead"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Szass Tam</b> is a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/zulkir\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"zulkir\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/zulkir\">zulkir</a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lich\" title=\"Lich\">lich</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Involvement\">Involvement</span></h2>\n<p>While he is never encountered, he is referenced in several instances. The <a href=\"/wiki/Ornate_Mirror\" title=\"Ornate Mirror\">Ornate Mirror</a>, a tool created which knew the thoughts of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ilyn_Toth\" title=\"Ilyn Toth\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/25px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/38px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/50px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ilyn Toth\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png/25px-Portrait_Custom.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8f/Portrait_Custom.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ilyn_Toth\" title=\"Ilyn Toth\">Ilyn Toth</a>, knew and despised him.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quotes\">Quotes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>\"What th-ink you of the zulkir know as Szass Tam?\" / \"A foul lich. May he die a thousand more deaths\", correct dialogue answer to the <a href=\"/wiki/Ornate_Mirror\" title=\"Ornate Mirror\">Ornate Mirror</a>.</li>\n<li>“Steady... This thing looks more brittle than Szass Tam's bones”, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/38px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/50px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gale\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png/25px-Portrait_Gale.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/11/Portrait_Gale.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Gale\" title=\"Gale\">Gale</a> when <a href=\"/wiki/Gale/Banter\" title=\"Gale/Banter\">stepping on a platform held by chains</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Szass_Tam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/33px-BGWiki.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/44px-BGWiki.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Szass Tam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b7/BGWiki.webp/22px-BGWiki.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b7/BGWiki.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Szass_Tam\">Szass Tam</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://baldursgate.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Baldur's Gate Wiki</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Szass_Tam\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Szass Tam\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Szass_Tam\">Szass Tam</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714205101\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []